cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Model Radar or its compiled data, please cite this project."
title: "Model Radar (模型雷达图)"
abstract: >-
  A scenario-based model comparison tool that normalizes public benchmark
  evidence into eight capability dimensions, scores evidence within benchmark
  families as pool-relative percentiles, and deliberately leaves missing
  dimensions blank rather than treating them as zero.
authors:
  - name: "HanGu007"
version: 0.24.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
url: "https://github.com/HanGu007/model-radar"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HanGu007/model-radar"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - large language models
  - model comparison
  - benchmark
  - data visualization
  - radar chart
  - open data
